    "result_text": "Both `@core` tests pass. The full-stack change is complete and verified.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented **project invoices** \u2014 opening a project shows its invoices, their total, and lets you add a new invoice \u2014 as a small, additive change across all three layers.\n\n**Database** (`src/main/resources/db/migration/V4__invoices.sql`)\n- New `invoices` table: `id`, `project_id` (FK \u2192 projects), `amount DECIMAL(12,2)`, following the existing `GENERATED BY DEFAULT` convention so seed fixtures can supply explicit ids.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST + Spring beans)\n- `Invoice` entity, `InvoiceRepository` (`findByProjectIdOrderByIdAsc`), `NewInvoice` request body.\n- `GET /api/invoices/{projectId}` (`InvoicesGet`, path param via `@HttpPathParameter`) \u2192 new yml under `rest/api/invoices/{projectId}.GET.yml`.\n- `POST /api/invoices` (`InvoicesPost`, validates amount \u2265 0 and an existing project) \u2192 `rest/api/invoices.POST.yml`.\n- Extended `TestSupportController` (not pinned) to seed `invoices` rows by explicit id and to `TRUNCATE ... RESTART IDENTITY` invoices in the FK chain on reset.\n\n**Front-end** (all new files, per the additive rules)\n- `routes/projects.tsx` \u2014 one-line `<Outlet />` layout so Projects can have a detail view.\n- `routes/projects.$projectId.tsx` \u2014 the detail page (drilling in is a child route, not a flag), composing the invoice form + table.\n- `features/invoices/` \u2014 `queries.ts` (per-project `['invoices', projectId]` key), `InvoicesTable.tsx` (renders `project-invoices-table`, `invoice-row-<id>`/`invoice-amount` at 2 decimals, and the client-side `project-invoices-total`), `InvoiceForm.tsx` (`invoice-form-amount`/`invoice-form-submit`, mutation invalidates the key).\n- `slots/defs/projectRow.ts` + `features/projects/open.slot.tsx` \u2014 a per-row slot filled with the `project-open-<id>` link; the only edit to an existing file was rendering that slot in `ProjectsTable`, which is the sanctioned \"declare-a-region + render-it\" extension pattern.\n\nThe audit service was left untouched since the spec asserts no audit records for this feature.",
